NOTES.md

# JPEG test fixtures are extracted from a BOUGHT book and this repo is public.
# Regenerate with tools/gen_jpeg_fixtures.sh <book.epub>.
tests/fixtures/jpeg/

# MP3 decoder fixture is a slice of a real track and this repo is public.
# Regenerate with tools/gen_mp3_fixtures.sh <file.mp3>.
tests/fixtures/mp3/

# T9 source corpus. Not committed: it is 612 KB of input that produces a committed
# 275 KB output, and the generated header records the source URL and a SHA-256 of this
# file, so a regeneration is provable without carrying the corpus in the history.
# Refetch with tools/t9-corpus/FETCH.md.
tools/t9-corpus/*.txt
